# Auto push after changes

Whenever you finish implementing or fixing something the user asked for:

1. Stage the relevant files
2. Create a concise commit (why, not what)
3. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`main`)

Do this without waiting for the user to say "push". Do not skip hooks. Do not force-push.
